## What I Learned

### Better Questions Lead to Better Decisions

Instead of immediately searching for answers, asking structured questions helps uncover the real problem and hidden assumptions.

### Visual Decision Frameworks Reduce Bias

Using weighted scoring and comparison matrices makes complex decisions easier to evaluate objectively.

### AI Can Support Critical Thinking

Rather than replacing human judgment, AI can organize information, highlight trade-offs, and reveal cognitive biases.

### Interactive Dashboards Improve Decision Making

Presenting insights visually makes recommendations easier to understand and act upon.

